## cloud@aws.ec2 · provision_verify · bin.without
rc=1
   ✋ ConstraintError: tailscale is not on PATH
      ⇒ the one package brings the client and tailscaled, so the daemon is not read apart
      ⇒ this grove's provisioner did not install or start tailscale
      ⇒ a grove's join is its provisioner's (ahbode/infrastructure):
          rhx tailscale.authkey.mint --grove <this grove> --mode apply
        then the provision path's join, as root, with --advertise-tags=tag:camp
writes: none

