## local@unix · provision_upsert · bin.without
rc=1
   💥 MalfunctionError: could not fetch tailscale's package repository key for '<codename>'
      ⇒ apt would report the source unsigned, and the error reads
        'NO_PUBKEY' rather than 'the key was never fetched'
      read why: curl -sSI https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/ubuntu/<codename>.noarmor.gpg
      fix: once the url answers, rerun — no write was made, so a rerun is safe:
        sudo -v && rhx grove.provision --what 5.23.tailscale --mode apply
writes: bundle.root.owns tailscale · web_tempdir · web_fetch https://pkgs.tailscale.com/stable/ubuntu/<codename>.noarmor.gpg --into <fixture>/tmp/tailscale.gpg
